WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.860
Sometimes things are just meant to be.

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:06.140
No wifi on this flight put me in a mindset.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.940
Not having a whole lot of work left to do 
put me in a mindset.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:16.280
This time, this moment, put me in a mindset 
and the mindset is real simple.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.460
I was able to read so many of your 
emails and your DM's right now. So many.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.900
So many people coming from 
so many different backgrounds.

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:29.760
So many different ages, heritages, religions, experiences

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:35.940
and I'm sitting here just saying to myself, 
"My God, everybody's got something."

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:39.500
Everybody's sitting right now 
as they're watching this video

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.440
and they've got something that they're dwelling about.

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:45.400
Something that's pulling them down, 
something that's holding them back.

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:49.920
Something that happened a long time ago, 
or something that's going on right now.

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:54.860
It just feels so intense for me right this second.

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:57.140
It feels really, really hard core for me.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:01.560
Just consuming all this content. All these questions.

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:09.160
And I'm in this circumstance where people 
want to ask me and I feel so gifted about it.

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:15.140
I don't know if I'm up to the task or not every time, 
but I know my intent is.

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:19.540
And I know I've desperately wanted to just make this video and let everybody know

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:21.640
that everybody's got something.

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:27.280
So many if you look around. Look at all those people 
and you think they've got it better

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:33.840
and default into thinking somebody's got 
a little more privilege, a little better.

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:41.220
Somewhere along the line I heard somebody say, 
"All of us are born  with a gift and a curse."

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:45.780
Right. Either we have too much or we have too little. 
And I get that.

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:49.780
I get that and I think about 
it's not where you start,  it's where you finish.

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:56.960
I see things that people don't see. 
Like people that are gifted with privilege

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:58.900
and it cripples them and it fucks them from the get

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:01.980
and they've lost before they've started

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:09.940
and obviously people that are born with so little 
and such different difficult circumstances.

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:17.860
Everybody's got something 
and it's always going to be like that

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:23.760
and I just want people to know that.

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:27.780
If we could just all deploy a little more empathy

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:36.100
and realize that it just makes it 
a little bit easier for you to deal with yours.

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:40.680
It's not misery loves company, 
it's actually completely the reverse.

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:46.720
It's wishing and wanting for everybody to win and realizing none of that comes at your expense.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:52.380
It's wishing and wanting that people can navigate through the maze of the circumstances they were dealt.

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.900
The hand they were given.

00:02:55.580 --> 00:03:00.680
It's wishing that they are surrounded by 
the people that can help them, or

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:05.920
they can consume something, whether it's 
a song, or a poem or a book or a movie,

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:11.400
or a video like this that switches their mindset. 
That inspires them,

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:16.100
galvanizes them, makes them realize they have no choice but to do it for themselves.

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:17.980
Nobody's going to do it for you.

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:20.900
Nobody's going to do it for you.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:23.280
There's people out there rooting for you,

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:25.180
there's people out there cheering for you.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:29.620
Your mom is cheering for you sometimes.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:34.320
My mother is rooting for you because she is the kindest.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:40.600
But just understanding that everybody's got something - 
liberates everything.

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:48.080
And allows you to put that piece of 
the equation on the shelf, tucked away.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:52.340
It's a non-variable because we've all got something.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:55.680
That's how this fucking game is dealt.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:04:01.920
Once you realize that, 
you stop worrying about everybody else.

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:04.760
You know why?

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:06.000
You stop worrying about everybody else because:

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:08.260
A: you realize they've got something.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:11.920
B: you don't give a fuck about their opinion - 
cause they've got something.

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:15.340
Everybody's got something. Everybody.

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:20.640
Everybody's got the trash. Everybody's got the pain.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:22.640
It puts us all in one footing.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:25.220
They come in different shapes and sizes.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:29.180
But to that fucking person, it's theirs.

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:34.700
So please my friends, please 
understand that everybody has something.

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:38.080
Everybody's got their fucking pain.

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:39.860
Now it's an even playing field.

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:44.720
Deploy empathy and deploy confidence in yourself,

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:49.220
cause nobody's judgement on you means shit, 
cause they've got something to.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:53.860
Do you know why I roll with peace? 
Or as close to as it gets?

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:58.940
Cause I just know that truth. 
That truth I put on a fucking pedestal.

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:03.258
It's been in me the whole time and it took 
this circumstance and this flight

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:05.840
to help me articulate it a little bit.

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:10.300
Everybody's got something, so I feel bad for them 
and I don't value them.

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:13.940
Nobody's opinion of me matters more than myself

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:18.120
and I don't judge anybody, cause 
I don't know their fucking reality,

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:21.800
cause everybody's got something. EVERYBODY!

